"largest single reason was {reason} ({nReason} rows). Every count and "
"percentage shown describes only the {nFinal} rows that remained, so the "
"figure is representative of the whole dataset only if the excluded rows have "
"the same age and gender make-up as the kept ones. The full breakdown is in "
"the Data Summary."
