"excluded before the contingency table is built, because counting missing "
"values as a category of their own adds a row or column to the table and "
"changes the degrees of freedom of the chi-square test. This option is "
"checked by default and is retained so that saved analyses and existing "
"scripts continue to load; clearing it does not re-admit missing values. A "
"notice reports how many rows were dropped whenever any were."
msgstr ""

